abstract: >-
  SciNetX is a Python-based platform for bibliometric, scientometric,
  and network analysis of scientific literature. It also supports custom
  datasets with or without associated literature papers, including broader
  general network analysis workflows.
keywords:
  - bibliometrics
  - scientometrics
  - network analysis
  - PubMed
  - OpenAlex
